<view class="page"><image class="bg" src="/images/runtime/mobile-login-emerald-stadium-v1.jpg" mode="aspectFill"></image><view class="shade"></view><view class="content"><view class="title">访问受限</view><view class="panel"><view class="lock"><image src="/images/icons/lock.svg" mode="aspectFit"></image></view><text class="main-title">当前账号暂无访问权限</text><text class="desc">你已登录，但不是该机构成员，或当前成员关系已停用。</text><view class="details"><view><image src="/images/icons/team.svg" mode="aspectFit"></image><text>申请访问机构</text><text>{{organizationName}}</text></view><view><image src="/images/icons/players.svg" mode="aspectFit"></image><text>申请账号</text><text>{{accountText}}</text></view><view><image src="/images/icons/warning.svg" mode="aspectFit"></image><text>当前状态</text><text class="{{statusClass}}">{{statusText}}</text></view></view><button bindtap="request" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{!canRequest}}">{{requestText}}</button><text class="back" bindtap="backLogin">返回登录</text><view class="error" wx:if="{{errorText}}">{{errorText}}</view></view><text class="foot">机构数据、赛事授权和岗位权限均需通过服务端校验。</text></view></view>
